ify/sbomify-action/contents/CLAUDE.md?ref=d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "patch": "@@ -26,7 +26,7 @@ uv run pytest\n \n ## Architecture\n \n-The project uses a **Protocol + Registry + Factory** pattern across four main subsystems (see `docs/adr/0001-plugin-architecture.md`).\n+The project uses a **Protocol + Registry + Factory** pattern across four main subsystems (see `docs/adr/0002-plugin-architecture.md`).\n \n ### Protocol Interface\n "}, {"sha": "1d3ca6019fad15ebddb3e1369af6313aa8721199", "filename": "README.md", "status": "modified", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1, "changes": 2, "blob_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/blob/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960/README.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/raw/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960/README.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/contents/README.md?ref=d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "patch": "@@ -1001,7 +1001,7 @@ sbomify attempts to populate these fields for each component:\n - **CycloneDX**: 1.3, 1.4, 1.5, 1.6, 1.7 (JSON)\n - **SPDX**: 2.2, 2.3, 3.0.1 (JSON / JSON-LD)\n \n-> \ud83d\udcd6 See [docs/adr/0001-plugin-architecture.md](docs/adr/0001-plugin-architecture.md) for architecture details.\n+> \ud83d\udcd6 See [docs/adr/0002-plugin-architecture.md](docs/adr/0002-plugin-architecture.md) for architecture details.\n \n ## Links\n "}, {"sha": "0329b7c895f67a8e13a99e6f50466a4d5eaa4125", "filename": "docs/adr/0001-record-architecture-decisions.md", "status": "added", "additions": 19, "deletions": 0, "changes": 19, "blob_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/blob/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960/docs%2Fadr%2F0001-record-architecture-decisions.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/raw/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960/docs%2Fadr%2F0001-record-architecture-decisions.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/contents/docs%2Fadr%2F0001-record-architecture-decisions.md?ref=d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@\n+# 1. Record architecture decisions\n+\n+Date: 2026-03-20\n+\n+## Status\n+\n+Accepted\n+\n+## Context\n+\n+We need to record the architectural decisions made on this project.\n+\n+## Decision\n+\n+We will use Architecture Decision Records, as [described by Michael Nygard](http://thinkrelevance.com/blog/2011/11/15/documenting-architecture-decisions).\n+\n+## Consequences\n+\n+See Michael Nygard's article, linked above. For a lightweight ADR toolset, see Nat Pryce's [adr-tools](https://github.com/npryce/adr-tools)."}, {"sha": "3b6b8b4b5b66a44c376e0001bc14722e0ac6042f", "filename": "docs/adr/0002-plugin-architecture.md", "status": "renamed", "additions": 3, "deletions": 1, "changes": 4, "blob_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/blob/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960/docs%2Fadr%2F0002-plugin-architecture.md", "raw_url": "https://github.com/sbomify/sbomify-action/raw/d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960/docs%2Fadr%2F0002-plugin-architecture.md", "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/sbomify/sbomify-action/contents/docs%2Fadr%2F0002-plugin-architecture.md?ref=d85b474b44c6818e41c0b52253632df662d83960", "patch": "@@ -1,4 +1,6 @@\n-# ADR-0001: Plugin Architecture for Extensibility\n+# 2. Plugin Architecture for Extensibility\n+\n+Date: 2025-01-16\n \n ## Status\n ", "previous_filename": "docs/adr/0001-plugin-architecture.md"}]}}